## Architecture After Phase 2 + 3

```
GitLab Webhook
    │
    ▼
webhook_receiver  ──Pub/Sub──▶  orchestrator/main.py (POST /pubsub/orchestrate)
                                       │  (background task — returns 200 immediately)
                                       ▼
                               orchestrator/agent.py
                                  │         │         │
                          gitlab MCP   dynatrace   arize MCP
                          (via SSE)    MCP (SSE)   (via SSE)
                                       │
                               environment_builder
                                  │         │
                            GCS archive  WireMock CR
                          (StorageSource) (real deploy)
                                  │
                           Cloud Run sim service
                                  │
                           traffic_replay + verdict_writer
                                  │
                           GitLab MR comment + pipeline status
```

